# .gitignore - P2 paper repository (rewritten 2026-10-04 when the v1 study was removed; v1 rules live at tag v1-final)

# ---- Python ----
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- Result and data files: NEVER in git ----
# Every .mat is a run product or wind data. The results the paper is built from live in results/ (one machine;
# their SHA-256 are listed in data/SHA256SUMS.txt and they go to Zenodo at submission). Wind segments are rebuilt
# by python/export_wind_sim.py from the public NREL M5 data.
*.mat
results/
dataset/
wind_conf2/
wind_e0check/
wind_expl_*
wind_conf_*
m5/
wind_real_*
e1b_cu/

# ONE .mat is tracked, because code needs it: core/p2_segset.m builds the P2 development pool from its 30 segments
# and core/p2_fixed5.m takes the N0P fixed-5 set from it (5 KB).
!field_grid_K050.mat

# ---- Model checkpoints: exactly one is tracked ----
# PROTOCOL_LOCK.md names w4_frozen_20hz_t150_train2345_s0 as the frozen wind predictor (trained on synthetic wind
# only, never retrained); the oracle study C3 uses it. The .json holds the architecture the .pt is rebuilt into.
*.pt
w4_frozen_*.json
!w4_frozen_20hz_t150_train2345_s0.pt
!w4_frozen_20hz_t150_train2345_s0.json

# ---- Run logs (cited by docs/REGISTER_P2.md; moved here by tools/local_tidy.py) ----
logs/

# ---- Simulink and MATLAB products, not sources ----
*.slxc
slprj/
*.autosave
*.original
*.asv
baseline1_baseline_backup.slx
.vscode/

# ---- Publisher PDFs used to check equations: never committed (copyright) ----
refs/
